repository-code: "https://github.com/ARETE-zzwl/jinsha-daily-drought-hybrid"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22232487"
abstract: "Code, processed station data, CMIP6 auxiliary training contexts, full prediction tables, and model checkpoints for a physics-deep learning hybrid framework that predicts custom 30-day and 90-day standardized water-balance drought indices and flash-drought early-risk probabilities. The release includes the eight-station Jinsha River Basin main experiment and a 16-station Upper Yellow River Basin external validation."
keywords:
  - drought forecasting
  - flash drought
  - hydrology
  - physics-guided machine learning
  - deep learning
  - water balance
  - cross-basin validation
  - Upper Yellow River Basin
